        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-11-04T17:43:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>You know how Christopher confirmed that One-shots stay in play and are only removed once they have been resolved? Would Mistbound stay in play for an entire round while it's effect is active?</p>",
