      {
        "id": 80525,
        "name": "Matchstickman",
        "username": "Matchstickman",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-11-04T19:16:31.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Just because it's ambiguous to us about whether it happens before or during the start of turn does not mean we get to lump it in with this new ruling because it happens to be similar. We need a ruling on what point it expires before we know how this new timing rule affects it.</p>",
