        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-11-04T19:46:10.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The new ruling still requires it to have timing to fall under hero choice, at least as far as I would say. &nbsp;I don't thik the new rule is quite as sweeping as people might jump to believing it is.</p>",
